<title>USA: Alliance Semiconductor names Alvarez CFO.</title>
<headline>Alliance Semiconductor names Alvarez CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliance Semiconductor Corp said Tuesday that Charles Alvarez has joined the company as vice president of finance and administration and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to say whom he succeeds in those posts.</p>
<p>Alvarez previously was director of finance and operations of the LSI Products Group of LSI Logic.</p>
